WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Manon recovers after the medal-building Renversé knockdown.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.150
Raw Drive Rush closes the distance as Ryu wakes up.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.950
Drive Rush crouching medium punch connects.

4
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.450
Standing medium punch follows the Rush medium.

5
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.950
Medium Dégagé converts the medium confirm into another knockdown.
